// helpers/mixed-res-helper.ta — cross-unit half of the mixed-spelling
// convergence test (docs/modules.md 契约 5). This helper loads lib/result
// via the identity full spelling with an explicit alias; the main file
// loads the same file via the bare-name sugar. Both spellings must resolve
// to the same unit (same canonical name -> same qualify prefix), so the
// helper's `res.` references and the main file's `result.` references hit
// one and the same prefix — independent of load order (the helper loads
// result first here).
import "github.com/tiancaiamao/tinyactor:lib/result" as res

pub fn check(r) { res.is_ok(r) }